  "worked_solution": "First, we find the principal value:\n\n$$\nx=\\operatorname{arctan}\u2061(0)={0}^{\u2218}\n$$\n\nSince ${0}^{\u2218}$ lies inside the given domain, our first solution is ${x}_{1}={0}^{\u2218}.$\n\nTo generate more solutions, we add integer multiples of ${180}^{\u2218}.$ Hence,\n\n$$\n{x}_{2}={180}^{\u2218}+{x}_{1}={180}^{\u2218}+{0}^{\u2218}={180}^{\u2218}.\n$$\n\nSo, in ascending order, the solutions are $x=0\\,{\\,}^{\u2218}$ and $x=180\\,{\\,}^{\u2218}.$",
